§ `The finding: the range names a paragraph that is printed as deleted`

-- 1. Every paragraph the range names is printed with text by the consolidation.
#ASSERT `every paragraph the range names is printed with text by the consolidation` (`range: the words "(1) עד (5)" at the end of s 35(b)`)
-- 2. No paragraph the range names is printed by the consolidation as deleted.
#ASSERT `the number of paragraphs the range names that the consolidation prints as deleted` (`range: the words "(1) עד (5)" at the end of s 35(b)`) EQUALS 0
-- 3. No paragraph the range names is directed deleted by an instrument this row read.
